---
title: TransactionTypeError.__init__ (Osaka Exceptions)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> q_init : start
    q_init --> q_validate : transaction_type received
    q_validate --> q_format : msg = f"unknown transaction type {transaction_type}"
    q_format --> q_super : super().__init__(msg)
    q_super --> q_assign : self.transaction_type = transaction_type
    q_assign --> [*] : raise TransactionTypeError

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: transaction_type is an int
        representing the EIP-2718 type byte
    end note

    note right of q_assign
        INV-002: TransactionTypeError is raised
        only for unknown type bytes
    end note
